Rule 3 (shape as list/tuple: 2D reshape preserves element count when no -1 is used)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : list(int) ⊎ tuple(int)} |= if ndim(v_1) = 2 ∧ v_2.len = 2 ∧ v_2[0] ≠ -1 ∧ v_2[1] ≠ -1 then v_2[0] * v_2[1] = shape(v_1, 0) * shape(v_1, 1)
