Rule 4 (shape as list/tuple: scalar target shape [] only for single-element input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : list(int) ⊎ tuple(int)} |= if v_2.len = 0 then (ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 1)
